<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian P-Notes - One tender of A$20 mln.</title>
<headline>Australian P-Notes - One tender of A$20 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market saw just one promissory note tender of A$20 million for McDonald's reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The August 15 dated issue fetched a 5.37 percent yield.</p>
